  "description": "Routes of OpenVibe.Chat as the OpenVibe contracts describe them (openvibe-contracts 0.87.0): each operation lists the capabilities it performs; a token for the service's audience must carry one of them unless the route is open. Generated by openvibe-contracts lib/openapi.js; do not edit.",
